{"kind":"finding","id":"F-rewind-refly-009-01","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/RewindSpawnSuppressionTests.cs","line":642,"method":"ShouldRetainMapPresenceForTerminalRealSpawn_SuppressedRewindMarker_NoMapPresenceRetained","category":"T1","severity":"Medium","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/ParsekPlaybackPolicy.cs:1288; delete the SpawnSuppressedByRewind clause -> still green (fixture has no TerminalOrbitBody/SMA, no OrbitSegments, no active hold, so the final expression is false anyway)","what_it_asserts":"ShouldRetainMapPresenceForTerminalRealSpawn(rec, hasFutureSegment:false) returns false for an Orbiting recording marked SpawnSuppressedByRewind","why_weak":"the marker clause is redundant in this fixture: the method returns false with or without it, so the asserted refusal proves nothing about the suppression gate the test names","proposed_action":"give the fixture TerminalOrbitBody plus a positive TerminalOrbitSemiMajorAxis (or an OrbitSegment) so the same call WITHOUT the marker returns true, then assert the marked copy flips to false","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"F-rewind-refly-009-02","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/MergeJournalOrchestratorTests.cs","line":1051,"method":"RunMerge_NullMarker_ReturnsFalse","category":"T1","severity":"Low","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/MergeJournalOrchestrator.cs:170; delete the marker==null guard -> still green because RunMerge(null,null) is caught by the provisional==null guard at :175","what_it_asserts":"RunMerge(null, null) returns false","why_weak":"passing a null provisional as well masks the marker guard: removal of the guard the test is named for leaves the test green, and the distinguishing Warn text is not asserted","proposed_action":"capture MakeStandardFixture's provisional and call RunMerge(null, provisional); the marker guard's removal then NREs at marker.SessionId","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"F-rewind-refly-009-03","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/RewindSpawnSuppressionTests.cs","line":1123,"method":"ShouldSpawnAtRecordingEnd_TreeContextLeaf_ReturnsTrue_ForPreservedCanonForkAfterParentRewind","category":"T3","severity":"Low","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/GhostPlaybackLogic.cs:8121; delete or stub IsEffectiveLeafForVessel -> still green because the fixture sets ChildBranchPointId=null at test line 1144, short-circuiting the call","what_it_asserts":"needsSpawn true and empty reason for an Immutable Orbiting recording attached to a one-node tree","why_weak":"the header comment says IsEffectiveLeafForVessel and IsNonLeafInTree walk the store and apply leaf-shaped logic, but the null ChildBranchPointId skips the first entirely and the tree has zero BranchPoints, so the test is observationally identical to its tree-less sibling","proposed_action":"either correct the comment or set ChildBranchPointId to a real branch point with recorded children so the effective-leaf/non-leaf paths actually run","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
